@startuml
!include ../style.iuml
|Analyst / Evaluator|
start
:Choose report format;
|System|
:Collect file details, prediction, top-3;
:Look up MITRE mapping of family;
if (heatmap computed?) then ([yes])
  :Attach heatmap overlay;
else ([no])
endif
if (format?) then ([PDF])
  :Generate PDF (FPDF2);
  if (generation succeeded?) then ([no])
    :Show error, offer JSON instead;
    stop
  else ([yes])
  endif
else ([JSON])
  :Generate structured JSON;
endif
:Log report event (format, gradcam flag);
:Offer file for download;
|Analyst / Evaluator|
:Save report;
stop
@enduml
